  decl_forward_err_after_full.pcpp - break step of decl_forward.pcpp:
  a forward type written after its full declaration (it declares nothing)

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\decl_forward_err_after_full.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\decl_forward_err_after_full.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
  The marked line reports that code; nothing else is reported.
